dL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"R6YhZypd362pEJvl1jN0EA","review_id":"2Jp86nGooIditpkGZoBdvw","date":"2020-02-28T01:55:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9246892929077148,"text_excerpt":"I have never been to the House of Blues and what a cool restaurant/bar! We missed happy hour which is from 3-6pm but luckily there was live music starting at 630pm. We ordered the brisket nachos and Cajun fries to share. 10/10- the food was delicious!! So happy with our order. The hostess and our waitress, Rebecca, were very nice and attentive. Highly recommend this place as eating/drinking with live music is always great!!"},{"business_id":"R6YhZypd362pEJvl1jN0EA","review_id":"EiD0dhqzDaRJ72A_q0Hf1w","date":"2019-08-17T02:13:28","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9176186323165894,"text_excerpt":"Stopped in on a Thursday right around the time that Happy Hour was about to end. The bartender was kind enough to extend it for us. Which we truly appreciated, it's the little things that show that you value your customers. I partook in some beer while here and at the prices they had, I was pleasantly surprised. My friends had decided to get an appetizer while we were here. I had already eaten or I would have selected something. They went with gator bites, at least that's what they told me. I would have tried one, but the corn dusting coating isn't the best for me. They said it was good and the dipping sauces were great. They said the hotter one doesn't hit you right away but sticks aroun..."},{"business_id":"R6YhZypd362pEJvl1jN0EA","review_id":"t5o6Lxg3g3yi3SIYlbEhaw","date":"2020-05-22T13:53:14","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.916568398475647,"text_excerpt":"I was here for a special event where we had a large section reserved for our private use. We had access to 2 bars just for our party and buffet of a basic salad and red beans and rice. The food was ok, and the bartenders were friendly, considering our rambunctious and rowdy party. I am not sure House of Blues is somewhere I would have picked on my own, it was still nice to be able to check it out."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"R6YhZypd362pEJvl1jN0EA","photo_id":"ulbt4dGSouyTQuDRQBILiw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/ulbt4dGSouyTQuDRQBILiw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8433406949043274},{"business_id":"R6YhZypd362pEJvl1jN0EA","photo_id":"CNRp4NyJtsI-KYKtckOm6g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/CNRp4NyJtsI-KYKtckOm6g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8319655060768127},{"business_id":"R6YhZypd362pEJvl1jN0EA","photo_id":"mrD1hDv0-3nxHyko-xSTPQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/mrD1hDv0-3nxHyko-xSTPQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8004450798034668},{"business_id":"R6YhZypd362pEJvl1jN0EA","photo_id":"uCDRERSdTxiouVrs6z9OMw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/uCDRERSdTxiouVrs6z9OMw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7871159911155701},{"business_id":"R6YhZypd362pEJvl1jN0EA","photo_id":"_ZsSm3XeAlpoS3uDhwislA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/_ZsSm3XeAlpoS3uDhwislA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7632511258125305}]},"notebook_case":null}
